   583→   583→+// CondenseAndMarkFullyCondensed condenses an ENDED session and marks it
   584→   584→+// FullyCondensed in one operation. Used by the session stop hook to eagerly
   585→   585→+// clean up sessions so PostCommit doesn't have to process them.
   586→   586→+//
   587→   587→+// This does NOT call CondenseSessionByID because that method has two behaviors
   588→   588→+// we don't want: (1) it calls clearSessionState when no shadow branch exists
   589→   589→+// (deletes the state file entirely), and (2) it sets Phase = IDLE. Instead,
   590→   590→+// we inline the condensation logic with ENDED-appropriate behavior.
